config FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ_FRITZ_PRESENCE
	bool "Domoticz plugin: presence detection via the FRITZ!Box"
	depends on FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ
	select FREETZ_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_FRITZCONNECTION
	default n
	help
		presence detection driven by the FRITZ!Box (devices seen by the router)

		It is a Python plugin of Domoticz: the package installs it into
		/usr/share/domoticz/plugins/domoticz-FritzPresence, the directory Domoticz is
		started with (-approot of the domoticz package), and it needs no
		change of the Domoticz build.

		The plugin needs python3-fritzconnection (installed as a
		dependency of this package) in addition to the standard library.

		Setup: Setup -> Hardware -> Fritz Presence, enter the address and credentials of the FRITZ!Box.

		Licensed upstream (LICENSE is installed with the plugin). The
		repository has no release tags, so the build fetches a pinned commit of
		the default branch.
